The strongest directly applicable evidence is a retrospective cohort explicitly described as having no overt structural heart disease; its fQRS prevalence increased with PVC count, with a borderline adjusted association. I’ll record both studies while distinguishing the weaker, not-confirmed disease-free cohort.

